WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.084 --> 01:44.136
=Episode 19=

01:50.356 --> 01:51.037
Next.

02:04.477 --> 02:05.956
Next up, Zhu Mengmeng.

02:07.277 --> 02:07.837
Next.

02:08.840 --> 02:12.232
(The Most Beautiful Youthful Voice)

02:16.876 --> 02:17.716
Zhu Mengmeng.

02:18.316 --> 02:19.357
Zhu Mengmeng.

02:21.957 --> 02:23.156
Seems like you're not ready.

02:23.957 --> 02:25.237
Don't take the stage unprepared.

02:25.876 --> 02:26.436
Next.

02:29.277 --> 02:30.117
Zhu Mengmeng.

02:31.277 --> 02:32.316
Is Zhu Mengmeng here?

02:33.957 --> 02:34.957
If not, next one.

02:39.156 --> 02:40.557
Here! I'm here.

02:42.024 --> 02:43.688
(Judge)

02:47.656 --> 02:49.448
(Voice of Dreams)

02:52.008 --> 02:53.768
(Voice of Dreams)

02:55.476 --> 02:56.837
Okay, begin your performance.

02:58.397 --> 03:00.557
Zhu Mengmeng, you may start.

03:07.720 --> 03:09.384
(Judge)

03:09.997 --> 03:12.596
♪If I open my eyes from a nightmare♪

03:13.517 --> 03:16.036
♪Facing this cruel world♪

03:16.237 --> 03:16.997
This isn't working.

03:17.397 --> 03:20.196
♪Whose heartstrings does the wind pluck♪

03:21.716 --> 03:22.997
(Ignore others' judgement.)

03:24.237 --> 03:26.277
Remember, you're singing for yourself

03:27.316 --> 03:28.876
and for those who appreciate you.

03:29.636 --> 03:30.436
Focus.

03:30.436 --> 03:31.476
Clear your mind.

03:31.916 --> 03:33.117
Then the nerves will fade.

03:34.237 --> 03:36.916
Right. Nothing else matters.

03:37.636 --> 03:39.316
What matters is making a strong start.

03:45.768 --> 03:53.384
♪Love's time machine,
flies, flies, flies♪

03:53.384 --> 04:01.192
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

04:01.512 --> 04:08.936
♪Love's time machine keeps on turning♪

04:11.636 --> 04:12.636
- She's good.
- Pretty good.

04:12.636 --> 04:13.476
Solid breath control.

04:13.476 --> 04:14.077
Good.

04:14.728 --> 04:21.960
♪Just to hold you♪

04:22.117 --> 04:22.677
Okay.

04:23.797 --> 04:24.557
You passed.

04:27.784 --> 04:29.512
(Voice of Dreams,
Singing Dreams, Sounding the Future)

04:29.640 --> 04:31.912
(Voice of Dreams Judge Score Sheet)

04:31.912 --> 04:38.504
(Zhu Mengmeng: Excellent)

04:40.584 --> 04:43.208
(Letao Tower)

04:50.037 --> 04:50.756
Mr. Gao.

04:51.516 --> 04:52.157
Mr. Li.

04:53.117 --> 04:53.677
Please, sit.

04:55.316 --> 04:55.912
Take a seat.

04:57.477 --> 04:59.797
Why didn't you take more time off?

04:59.997 --> 05:01.117
I'm mostly recovered.

05:02.717 --> 05:04.557
The marketing team told me

05:05.157 --> 05:07.196
product development is going smoothly.

05:07.756 --> 05:08.424
Yes.

05:08.997 --> 05:10.037
Here, look at this.

05:11.592 --> 05:12.680
(Boli Capital and Letao
Cooperation Proposal)

05:14.557 --> 05:15.196
Boli?

05:17.037 --> 05:19.797
Based on our new product's

05:19.797 --> 05:20.836
market performance,

05:20.836 --> 05:21.597
Boli has offered us

05:21.597 --> 05:23.836
very favorable cooperation terms.

05:26.568 --> 05:27.636
(Cooperation Proposal)
Mr. Li,

05:28.636 --> 05:30.717
Boli Capital is foreign capital.

05:34.117 --> 05:36.636
As long as it benefits Letao's future,

05:37.037 --> 05:39.477
what difference does foreign
or domestic capital make?

05:40.956 --> 05:42.636
Letting foreign capital invest now

05:42.636 --> 05:44.557
means we'll be led by the nose later.

05:46.076 --> 05:46.956
Haiming.

05:47.316 --> 05:50.037
Sometimes, people shouldn't
be too stubborn.

05:51.237 --> 05:52.917
Now many companies are eager

05:52.917 --> 05:54.396
to attract foreign investment.

05:54.956 --> 05:56.316
Besides, consumers nowadays

05:56.316 --> 05:58.316
prefer imported products.

05:59.037 --> 06:01.797
This is the future trend.

06:06.316 --> 06:06.917
Mr. Li,

06:08.196 --> 06:09.117
there's no such thing

06:09.357 --> 06:10.396
as a free lunch.

06:11.436 --> 06:12.917
I don't want foreign capital

06:12.917 --> 06:14.117
to restrict our product R&D.

06:14.636 --> 06:17.477
Plus, I don't want our domestic brand,
built with hard work,

06:17.876 --> 06:18.516
to transform

06:18.516 --> 06:20.836
into some so-called imported product.

06:26.196 --> 06:26.997
Haiming,

06:27.677 --> 06:31.237
Letao has weathered
decades of challenges.

06:32.276 --> 06:36.712
All of us want Letao to thrive, right?

06:39.876 --> 06:41.396
Alright, I won't disturb you further.

06:45.037 --> 06:46.117
Think it over carefully.

06:47.316 --> 06:48.157
- Alright.
- Take care.

06:56.117 --> 06:56.756
Luo.

06:59.516 --> 07:02.117
- Mr. Gao.
- Take this to Legal Department.

07:02.117 --> 07:02.677
Okay.

07:09.876 --> 07:10.597
Congratulations.

07:10.836 --> 07:12.117
Male Lead's fondness toward you

07:12.117 --> 07:13.636
has risen to 96 percent.

07:15.357 --> 07:18.836
Mr. Gao, Lin Huan'er
is playing hard to get.

07:19.117 --> 07:20.477
She wants a cat-and-mouse game.

07:21.316 --> 07:22.396
Why are you still here?

07:24.436 --> 07:25.276
I'm leaving.

07:37.636 --> 07:39.677
(Mrs. Gao, new message)
(Lin Huan'er, Hello.)

07:40.037 --> 07:41.677
(I am Gao Haiming's mother.)

07:42.076 --> 07:42.997
(I'm unwell.)

07:43.717 --> 07:45.157
(I need to talk to you.)

07:45.597 --> 07:47.117
(Please, don't tell Haiming.)

07:56.584 --> 07:59.560
(Inpatient)

08:12.597 --> 08:13.117
Mrs. Gao.

08:13.997 --> 08:15.997
Huan'er, come. Take a seat.

08:19.516 --> 08:20.677
I hope you don't mind

08:21.436 --> 08:22.717
me calling you over.

08:23.917 --> 08:25.196
Of course not.

08:26.157 --> 08:27.157
How are you feeling?

08:28.756 --> 08:30.557
I just felt unwell

08:31.157 --> 08:32.197
back when I was in Sweden.

08:33.237 --> 08:35.516
I thought, maybe I should just
return home first.

08:35.837 --> 08:37.957
So, right after coming back,
I came to the hospital.

08:40.437 --> 08:41.516
Does the Chairman know?

08:41.837 --> 08:43.276
He's busy with other matters.

08:44.676 --> 08:45.276
Mrs. Gao,

08:45.796 --> 08:47.036
I think you should

08:47.516 --> 08:49.036
tell Haiming as soon as possible.

08:50.796 --> 08:52.676
I'm truly happy for Haiming.

08:54.237 --> 08:55.796
Ever since he met you,

08:56.676 --> 08:58.516
even I didn't realize

08:59.237 --> 09:00.796
he had such a passionate

09:01.197 --> 09:02.837
and childlike side.

09:05.717 --> 09:06.396
Huan'er.

09:07.916 --> 09:08.717
Thank you.

09:10.516 --> 09:11.717
It's so good to have you.

09:14.357 --> 09:14.916
Mrs. Gao.

09:16.876 --> 09:17.556
You...

09:19.876 --> 09:21.437
Actually, I haven't been a good mother.

09:24.597 --> 09:25.756
I was young at that time.

09:27.036 --> 09:28.556
Because of family troubles,

09:30.237 --> 09:31.796
when Haiming was very little,

09:33.077 --> 09:35.837
I once tried to jump into the sea
with him in my arms.

09:39.636 --> 09:42.156
I've always felt guilty towards him.

09:43.516 --> 09:44.516
Even now,

09:45.036 --> 09:46.077
I still don't know

09:46.516 --> 09:49.036
if he has truly
forgiven me in his heart.

09:51.997 --> 09:53.317
My greatest wish now

09:55.717 --> 09:57.237
is for him to be happy.

10:02.077 --> 10:03.796
So I want to ask you a favor.

10:04.756 --> 10:05.756
Please help me

10:06.997 --> 10:08.036
take good care of him.

10:09.396 --> 10:10.197
Will you?

10:17.197 --> 10:17.796
Mrs. Gao,

10:19.676 --> 10:20.997
don't think about these now.

10:22.317 --> 10:25.357
The most important thing now
is to focus on recovering your health.

10:26.717 --> 10:28.117
No matter how well I care for him,

10:28.276 --> 10:29.317
or how kind I am to him,

10:30.276 --> 10:32.597
I can never replace
your place in his heart.

10:36.837 --> 10:37.837
Certain things

10:39.357 --> 10:40.437
should be told by yourself

10:41.396 --> 10:42.396
once you're better.

10:49.197 --> 10:49.756
Haiming?

10:51.717 --> 10:52.936
Alright, I'm leaving.

10:52.936 --> 10:53.640
You go ahead.

10:56.237 --> 10:56.796
Mom.

10:59.077 --> 10:59.756
Such a big thing,

10:59.756 --> 11:00.916
why didn't you tell me?

11:01.676 --> 11:02.357
What illness?

11:02.997 --> 11:04.276
It's no big deal.

11:04.837 --> 11:06.876
The hospital hasn't issued
the diagnosis report yet.

11:07.077 --> 11:09.357
See? I'm perfectly fine.

11:10.077 --> 11:11.597
How about we go out for a walk?

11:17.197 --> 11:19.997
I like Huan'er.

11:21.876 --> 11:23.077
I'm truly happy for you both.

11:24.837 --> 11:25.997
Take good care of each other.

11:30.957 --> 11:33.957
Don't hold a grudge against me anymore.

11:36.317 --> 11:37.317
Because of that thing...

11:37.317 --> 11:37.896
Mom,

11:38.796 --> 11:39.556
I don't blame you.

11:42.837 --> 11:44.156
I'm doing fine now, aren't I?

11:45.516 --> 11:46.197
I've grown up.

11:50.036 --> 11:51.276
Really no grudge?

11:57.516 --> 11:58.796
My boy has grown up.

12:00.837 --> 12:01.796
All these years,

12:02.357 --> 12:04.276
I knew you had a shadow in your heart.

12:05.437 --> 12:06.516
Because of that incident,

12:07.117 --> 12:08.597
you refused to go near the sea.

12:10.636 --> 12:11.997
I just felt

12:15.036 --> 12:16.477
I didn't take good care of you.

12:20.636 --> 12:21.156
Mom,

12:22.396 --> 12:23.997
I have my own life now.

12:25.597 --> 12:26.237
So shouldn't you

12:27.597 --> 12:29.357
start living for yourself?

12:31.556 --> 12:33.396
Although my childhood memories
are a bit hazy,

12:34.997 --> 12:36.237
I always remember

12:37.117 --> 12:38.477
that photo album I saw.

12:40.556 --> 12:42.036
You looked radiant in those pictures.

12:45.156 --> 12:45.997
In my heart,

12:47.117 --> 12:48.276
you've always been like that.

12:52.916 --> 12:53.437
Truly.

13:22.357 --> 13:22.957
(I can wait.)

13:24.276 --> 13:25.197
It will happen someday.

13:27.317 --> 13:28.276
(As the female lead,)

13:28.437 --> 13:29.676
(your ultimate quest)

13:29.676 --> 13:31.796
(is to fall in love
with the male lead, Gao Haiming.)

13:31.916 --> 13:33.117
(Only by gaining his proposal)

13:33.237 --> 13:34.997
(can you return to your original world.)

13:35.477 --> 13:38.437
I want them to love passionately
in my book,

13:38.437 --> 13:39.876
without any regrets.

13:45.837 --> 13:47.957
So as long as he doesn't propose to me,

13:49.957 --> 13:51.597
I can stay with him a little longer?

13:53.156 --> 13:53.756
Sorry,

13:53.756 --> 13:55.717
players aren't allowed
to exploit system bugs.

13:55.916 --> 13:57.556
Otherwise, no one can predict

13:57.636 --> 13:58.760
(Loading)
the consequences.

13:58.957 --> 13:59.876
Why?

14:03.317 --> 14:05.197
I just want to spend more time with him.

14:07.036 --> 14:09.237
Even if we're truly in love,
is that still not allowed?

14:10.756 --> 14:11.556
Sorry, Player.

14:11.717 --> 14:13.756
Your time limit only extends
until the Millennium.

14:13.992 --> 14:15.317
(Loading)

14:15.317 --> 14:16.396
The Millennium?

14:17.597 --> 14:18.396
What do you mean?

14:19.197 --> 14:20.916
If the Player fails
to complete the quest

14:20.916 --> 14:22.276
and obtain Gao Haiming's proposal,

14:22.837 --> 14:25.516
Gao Haiming
and this whole world will collapse

14:25.597 --> 14:26.556
and disappear forever.

14:32.237 --> 14:33.357
Why is this happening?

14:50.717 --> 14:51.237
Hello?

14:53.437 --> 14:54.156
Where are you?

14:58.156 --> 14:58.756
Gao Haiming.

15:00.437 --> 15:00.997
Huan'er.

15:09.117 --> 15:09.717
What's wrong?

15:15.597 --> 15:16.357
Gao Haiming.

15:18.717 --> 15:20.676
Let's not wait until tomorrow, okay?

15:23.117 --> 15:24.997
Let's be together right now.

15:25.800 --> 15:29.276
♪I boarded a rickety time machine♪

15:29.276 --> 15:30.717
I won't run away anymore.

15:32.197 --> 15:33.796
I want to be with you.

15:36.237 --> 15:38.317
I want to go to the park,

15:39.197 --> 15:40.556
watch movies,

15:41.756 --> 15:43.036
go to amusement parks with you,

15:44.117 --> 15:46.237
and cook and eat meals together.

15:46.957 --> 15:48.036
There are so many things

15:48.036 --> 15:49.876
I want to do with you.

15:51.636 --> 15:53.997
Before we've been through everything,

15:54.756 --> 15:55.357
I don't want...

15:57.396 --> 15:59.357
Okay.

16:00.516 --> 16:03.636
Then let's watch movies,

16:04.276 --> 16:05.237
go to amusement parks,

16:05.477 --> 16:06.197
and go on dates.

16:07.957 --> 16:09.477
Anything you want to do,

16:09.477 --> 16:10.317
I'll do it with you.

16:11.756 --> 16:13.516
We have a long, long time.

16:13.516 --> 16:15.197
You can do so many things.

16:15.477 --> 16:16.077
Alright?

16:16.077 --> 16:20.616
♪Streaking across the sky♪

16:23.837 --> 16:25.077
Lin Huan'er, congratulations!

16:25.437 --> 16:26.957
Gao Haiming's fondness toward you

16:26.957 --> 16:28.276
has reached 100 percent.

16:28.516 --> 16:30.237
You're getting closer to going home!

16:39.997 --> 16:40.516
What's wrong?

16:43.784 --> 16:47.720
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

16:48.636 --> 16:49.357
Gao Haiming,

16:51.036 --> 16:52.477
I think I'm really foolish.

16:53.597 --> 16:55.276
Because I'm afraid of losing you,

16:56.676 --> 16:58.357
I never dared to face it.

17:00.197 --> 17:01.276
You won't lose me.

17:06.632 --> 17:14.440
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

17:16.596 --> 17:17.596
It's so real.

17:21.356 --> 17:21.997
Of course.

17:23.036 --> 17:24.076
Do you think I'm fake?

17:28.917 --> 17:30.276
Of course, you're not fake.

17:31.877 --> 17:34.276
You are truly a person
who exists in this world.

18:04.520 --> 18:06.237
(Inpatient)

18:06.237 --> 18:07.237
The test result is out.

18:07.677 --> 18:08.997
Your mother's result is benign.

18:09.717 --> 18:10.477
Thank you.

18:10.957 --> 18:11.592
You're welcome.

18:16.477 --> 18:17.288
Why are you here?

18:17.717 --> 18:18.796
I brought you breakfast.

18:19.477 --> 18:20.237
Come, sit down.

18:24.237 --> 18:25.316
You didn't sleep all night?

18:25.997 --> 18:26.717
Results are out.

18:27.157 --> 18:27.796
Nothing serious.

18:28.756 --> 18:31.464
The doctor said with proper rest,
my mom can be discharged soon.

18:31.957 --> 18:32.637
That's great!

18:33.877 --> 18:34.836
I should thank you.

18:35.796 --> 18:36.997
Why thank me?

18:36.997 --> 18:37.917
I didn't do anything.

18:38.917 --> 18:40.356
My mom is especially happy today.

18:40.516 --> 18:41.157
Really?

18:45.237 --> 18:47.437
Y-You told her everything?

18:51.477 --> 18:52.456
As long as she's happy.

18:54.836 --> 18:56.197
Thanks. Eat your breakfast now.

18:58.677 --> 18:59.556
What did you make?

19:01.704 --> 19:02.824
(Letao Tower)

19:12.036 --> 19:13.992
Wait. Here's the plan.

19:14.997 --> 19:17.116
Drive the car
to that small road up ahead.

19:17.116 --> 19:17.957
Drop me off there.

19:18.437 --> 19:19.116
Why?

19:19.677 --> 19:20.516
Well...

19:21.356 --> 19:22.917
You drive me to work so conspicuously.

19:22.917 --> 19:24.756
I don't think it's good
if colleagues see us.

19:24.957 --> 19:26.397
Isn't it better to be open about it?

19:27.917 --> 19:29.877
I just think we should
keep a lower profile.

19:38.677 --> 19:39.276
Have they left?

19:42.917 --> 19:43.596
Have they left?

19:44.997 --> 19:45.796
They've left.

19:50.637 --> 19:52.516
So, I'll get off first.

19:52.957 --> 19:54.637
You stay here for five minutes and go,

19:54.957 --> 19:55.477
okay?

19:55.477 --> 19:56.136
Hold on.

20:00.237 --> 20:01.036
What do you mean?

20:01.316 --> 20:03.677
It's reasonable for an assistant
to park the boss's car,

20:03.997 --> 20:04.516
right?

20:05.637 --> 20:08.237
Yes. You're so thoughtful.

20:08.556 --> 20:09.157
It's settled.

20:09.397 --> 20:10.088
Okay.

20:18.877 --> 20:19.556
Hello, Mr. Gao.

20:28.116 --> 20:29.997
Mr. Gao, I've parked your car for you.

20:29.997 --> 20:30.796
Here's your key.

20:32.356 --> 20:33.076
Keep them.

20:33.356 --> 20:34.556
Aren't we going back together?

20:40.116 --> 20:41.637
No. That's not it.

20:42.556 --> 20:44.836
Tonight, I'll take Mr. Gao home first.

20:44.836 --> 20:46.237
And then, I'll head home.

20:46.437 --> 20:47.316
To our own places.

20:48.637 --> 20:49.256
Got it.

20:49.516 --> 20:50.917
I believe you. I believe all of it.

20:51.356 --> 20:51.944
I believe.

20:52.596 --> 20:53.157
I really do.

20:53.756 --> 20:54.472
I believe it too.

21:06.197 --> 21:06.997
No, that's not it.

21:09.756 --> 21:10.437
Well...

21:11.756 --> 21:13.036
- Do you think they will
- It doesn't seem true.

21:13.036 --> 21:14.877
- really go back together?
- It seems true.

21:18.877 --> 21:19.464
I've got this.

21:21.356 --> 21:22.184
Careful, it's hot.

21:25.276 --> 21:26.356
Mr. Gao poured her water.

21:26.477 --> 21:27.397
Personally.

21:27.516 --> 21:29.316
I told you. Something's going on
between them.

21:31.917 --> 21:32.756
What would you like?

21:32.756 --> 21:33.516
Let me help.

21:34.237 --> 21:36.356
I remember the one
you gave me last time is called

21:37.076 --> 21:39.316
something by the Seine...

21:39.316 --> 21:40.596
Coffee on the Left Bank.

21:40.836 --> 21:41.997
Yes! That's the one I want.

21:42.756 --> 21:45.197
What's that? By the Seine?

21:46.397 --> 21:47.197
What does that mean?

21:47.197 --> 21:47.997
What is that?

21:49.237 --> 21:51.276
Just some secret code
between young lovers.

21:52.637 --> 21:53.437
Okay, I'll make it

21:53.437 --> 21:54.316
and bring it over.

21:54.316 --> 21:55.116
You may leave.

21:55.836 --> 21:56.397
Alright.

22:11.397 --> 22:12.036
You're here.

22:16.397 --> 22:17.036
Have a seat.

22:29.076 --> 22:29.796
Mei Yunzhi,

22:31.276 --> 22:32.717
when did this happen?

22:33.477 --> 22:35.237
Why didn't you tell me?

22:35.637 --> 22:36.877
It wasn't a big deal.

22:39.997 --> 22:43.756
I never thought I'd live
to hear you care about me.

22:44.356 --> 22:44.997
Not easy.

22:45.637 --> 22:46.997
What are you talking about?

22:46.997 --> 22:48.036
We are husband and wife.

22:48.397 --> 22:49.477
What do you mean by that?

22:52.477 --> 22:53.316
Gao Mingshan,

22:57.397 --> 22:58.316
let's get divorced.

23:01.157 --> 23:01.917
What do you mean?

23:03.437 --> 23:04.157
Get divorced?

23:05.036 --> 23:05.957
Why do we do that?

23:10.920 --> 23:12.637
(Divorce Agreement
Wife: Mei Yunzhi, Husband: Gao Mingshan)

23:12.637 --> 23:13.917
Here's the divorce agreement.

23:14.917 --> 23:15.637
Take a look.

23:16.488 --> 23:19.176
(Divorce Agreement
Wife: Mei Yunzhi, Husband: Gao Mingshan)

23:31.437 --> 23:32.516
During my whole life,

23:34.036 --> 23:35.197
I've been too weak.

23:36.717 --> 23:39.637
After giving birth,
I got postpartum depression.

23:40.677 --> 23:42.197
The one I owe the most is our son.

23:44.836 --> 23:46.356
I have never had the courage

23:47.116 --> 23:48.556
to ask for his forgiveness.

23:51.036 --> 23:51.997
After all these years,

23:53.516 --> 23:55.237
we've lost all feelings for each other.

23:58.836 --> 24:00.796
We should've
let go of each other long ago.

24:02.957 --> 24:06.516
I never dared
to bring up divorce with you.

24:08.076 --> 24:09.877
But after this illness,

24:11.596 --> 24:13.157
I've realized many things.

24:15.877 --> 24:16.877
For the rest of my life,

24:18.477 --> 24:19.917
I want to live for myself.

24:23.637 --> 24:28.036
If you still have any affection for me,

24:31.237 --> 24:32.556
please sign the agreement.

24:54.237 --> 24:56.756
Come on. Let's rehearse
the opening dance.

24:57.917 --> 24:58.637
Get in position.

24:59.316 --> 25:01.237
This is your first on-camera appearance.

25:01.717 --> 25:02.516
Just look sharp.

25:03.316 --> 25:04.477
Xiong, you two over there,

25:04.477 --> 25:05.276
go to the left side.

25:06.356 --> 25:07.197
You two in front,

25:07.197 --> 25:08.356
and you two in the back,

25:08.677 --> 25:10.677
to the right.
You three are in the center.

25:12.036 --> 25:15.157
Miss, Mengmeng is taller than me.
I suggest she stand in the back.

25:15.917 --> 25:16.796
Yes, Miss.

25:16.796 --> 25:18.076
That does seem more reasonable.

25:19.237 --> 25:20.637
The arrangement stays. No changes.

25:20.680 --> 25:21.197
But...

25:21.197 --> 25:21.800
Enough.

25:21.957 --> 25:22.836
Get in formation.

25:23.237 --> 25:23.997
Start rehearsing.

25:24.717 --> 25:25.237
Positions.

25:26.596 --> 25:27.957
She doesn't dance that well.

25:28.157 --> 25:28.717
Start.

25:28.997 --> 25:30.157
One,

25:30.356 --> 25:32.957
two, three,

25:32.957 --> 25:35.637
four, five,

25:35.637 --> 25:38.116
six, seven,

25:38.356 --> 25:39.477
and eight.

25:59.917 --> 26:00.836
She's not that great.

26:00.836 --> 26:02.197
Why does she dance in the center?

26:02.197 --> 26:02.997
Exactly.

26:08.356 --> 26:11.316
(Mengmeng, there will be constant
mishaps during this competition.)

26:11.997 --> 26:13.276
(Stay adaptable.)

26:13.677 --> 26:15.677
(Just be yourself,
and ignore everything else.)

26:16.076 --> 26:16.917
(You've got this.)

26:21.960 --> 26:24.232
(Letao Tower)

26:31.836 --> 26:33.957
How was it? Quite successful.

26:34.677 --> 26:35.316
Are you tired?

26:35.917 --> 26:36.477
Yes.

26:37.197 --> 26:38.276
But I'm happy!

26:38.556 --> 26:39.556
The Her Series

26:39.556 --> 26:41.276
got orders nationwide.

26:41.637 --> 26:43.356
It shows our brand strategy works.

26:43.796 --> 26:44.677
It's taken off.

26:44.957 --> 26:45.957
So we'll keep working.

26:46.596 --> 26:47.276
Back to work.

26:52.356 --> 26:52.997
It's not right.

26:53.957 --> 26:54.677
What's not right?

26:56.796 --> 26:59.596
It seems after we got together,

27:00.316 --> 27:01.397
you love your work more.

27:03.637 --> 27:06.237
I just want to make
the most of limited time

27:06.877 --> 27:08.276
to help you with more tasks.

27:12.637 --> 27:16.677
Limited time?
Thinking about job-hopping?

27:20.957 --> 27:22.516
What if you upset me?

27:23.036 --> 27:25.717
Or if another company
poaches me with higher pay?

27:26.356 --> 27:27.276
Impossible.

27:28.116 --> 27:29.437
I won't let you leave me.

27:33.437 --> 27:34.877
Your birthday is next month.

27:34.877 --> 27:36.036
How will you celebrate?

27:39.237 --> 27:40.456
I don't celebrate birthdays.

27:42.556 --> 27:44.197
Birthdays commemorate

27:44.596 --> 27:45.997
your arrival in this world.

27:46.717 --> 27:47.437
Each of us

27:47.437 --> 27:49.836
leaves our mark in this world.

27:52.197 --> 27:53.877
So we should celebrate.

27:57.157 --> 27:57.717
Okay.

27:58.397 --> 28:00.356
I'll celebrate if you're with me.

28:09.917 --> 28:11.397
I'm thirsty.

28:11.397 --> 28:12.516
Get me some water.

28:12.877 --> 28:13.877
Okay, I'll pour it.

28:38.036 --> 28:38.877
(Sorry, Player.)

28:39.036 --> 28:41.076
(Your time limit only extends
until the Millennium.)

28:44.157 --> 28:45.437
This water is a bit hot.

28:45.877 --> 28:46.917
Drink it later when...

28:49.836 --> 28:50.477
What's wrong?

28:51.717 --> 28:52.717
W-Why are you crying?

28:57.237 --> 28:57.957
Gao Haiming.

29:01.836 --> 29:02.596
On New Year's Eve,

29:04.756 --> 29:05.997
propose to me, okay?

29:07.717 --> 29:08.397
Why?

29:10.437 --> 29:12.397
I mean, why that day?

29:15.556 --> 29:16.677
Didn't people say

29:18.157 --> 29:20.437
the world will end

29:20.437 --> 29:21.477
as the New Year arrives?

29:24.076 --> 29:26.316
If you propose then,

29:28.157 --> 29:30.036
I'd have no regrets if the world ended.

29:43.076 --> 29:43.677
Alright.

30:09.437 --> 30:10.756
After round one training,

30:10.917 --> 30:12.997
your group's top scorer

30:15.917 --> 30:16.957
is Zhu Mengmeng.

30:33.397 --> 30:34.157
Hello, Mengmeng?

30:34.477 --> 30:35.076
What's up?

30:37.276 --> 30:39.717
My training scores are out.
Ranking first in the group.

30:40.437 --> 30:41.076
Really?

30:42.116 --> 30:42.836
Great!

30:43.276 --> 30:44.076
Congratulations!

30:44.637 --> 30:46.157
You are flattering me.

30:46.157 --> 30:47.596
I haven't won the championship.

30:48.917 --> 30:50.957
The top scorer in the group
will surely win.

30:51.356 --> 30:52.036
I believe in you.

30:53.877 --> 30:54.568
By the way,

30:54.756 --> 30:56.157
how's your training?

30:56.157 --> 30:56.836
Going smoothly?

30:57.116 --> 30:57.877
Getting used to it?

30:58.717 --> 30:59.796
Anyone bullying you?

31:06.437 --> 31:07.076
What's wrong?

31:14.596 --> 31:15.276
Hello, Mengmeng?

31:16.157 --> 31:17.316
Did something happen?

31:18.276 --> 31:19.356
I'll take time off for you.

31:21.197 --> 31:21.836
No.

31:25.116 --> 31:28.237
I just haven't
heard your voice for long.

31:29.276 --> 31:30.157
Got a bit emotional.

31:36.437 --> 31:37.157
Me too.

31:37.997 --> 31:38.596
Mengmeng,

31:39.717 --> 31:41.997
I know you're under pressure.

31:42.756 --> 31:43.997
But I think

31:45.197 --> 31:46.157
just follow your heart.

31:47.917 --> 31:49.397
Your happiness matters most.

31:50.237 --> 31:51.116
And remember.

31:52.276 --> 31:54.957
I'm always here with you.

32:02.957 --> 32:04.237
I need to train now.

32:04.556 --> 32:06.796
You get back to work. Don't worry.

32:07.957 --> 32:08.556
Okay.

32:09.637 --> 32:10.316
Good luck.

32:13.717 --> 32:14.276
Okay.

32:30.516 --> 32:31.316
(Sir,)

32:31.677 --> 32:33.076
(please help publish)

32:33.076 --> 32:34.677
(my latest comic draft.)

33:45.608 --> 33:46.472
(Traffic Police)

33:46.997 --> 33:51.316
The comic you asked me to print.
I didn't expect you to like this.

33:51.796 --> 33:52.356
Thanks.

34:06.920 --> 34:09.256
(Police)

34:09.757 --> 34:11.236
Liu, lend me your phone?

34:11.236 --> 34:11.997
I need to text.

34:13.997 --> 34:14.596
Thank you.

34:22.757 --> 34:23.357
Thanks.

34:24.236 --> 34:25.917
Voting for Mengmeng again?

34:26.437 --> 34:28.116
You're completely obsessed.

34:29.116 --> 34:30.477
Does she even know

34:30.477 --> 34:31.636
you are so devoted to her?

34:31.797 --> 34:33.516
Right, how many phones do you have?

34:33.716 --> 34:34.716
Mind helping me vote?

34:34.716 --> 34:35.437
I'll pay you.

34:36.997 --> 34:38.196
It's just a small favor.

34:38.676 --> 34:39.516
Listen.

34:39.877 --> 34:41.877
My wife really likes her too.

34:42.317 --> 34:44.797
She said Mengmeng's genuine
and unaffected.

34:45.236 --> 34:47.036
She doesn't act like a rich girl at all.

34:47.397 --> 34:48.997
And most importantly, she sings well.

34:49.797 --> 34:50.440
Tiehan,

34:50.837 --> 34:52.397
we're all dying to hear her sing.

34:52.837 --> 34:54.277
So when exactly

34:54.277 --> 34:55.797
will you bring her over

34:55.797 --> 34:56.917
for a performance?

34:59.076 --> 34:59.797
Alright.

34:59.797 --> 35:01.196
I'll stop talking, okay?

35:01.837 --> 35:03.556
You two are taking forever.

35:04.076 --> 35:06.516
When will this ever end?

35:13.272 --> 35:16.255
♪Entwined worries linger♪

35:17.464 --> 35:20.235
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

35:22.136 --> 35:28.049
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

35:29.846 --> 35:32.906
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

35:34.072 --> 35:37.524
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

35:38.520 --> 35:44.046
♪Until the world's end♪

35:46.456 --> 35:50.252
♪If I could♪

35:50.840 --> 35:53.656
♪Keep loving you♪

35:54.680 --> 35:57.080
♪Hearing two hearts♪

35:57.080 --> 36:01.996
♪Beating together♪

36:02.968 --> 36:06.832
♪If I could♪

36:06.832 --> 36:10.072
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

36:11.128 --> 36:18.453
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

36:19.512 --> 36:22.456
